    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Base class for a filter that edits a group of caller/callee graphs across many ``.ini`` files
:raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

Note that this derives from :cpp:class:`BaseIniPartEdit` **directly**, not from
:cpp:class:`BaseIniGraphPartEdit` -- matching the pure-Python original, since this edits whole
*groups* of graphs rather than one part within a single graph :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`
:raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

.. note::
   Every method here works through :cpp:class:`IIniGraphGroups` rather than a concrete
   container, so one implementation serves both a plain C++ caller and the `pybind11`_ layer
   -- see that interface&apos;s own top-level note for why that seam is necessary here and nowhere
   else in this codebase
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>K</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the keys stored in a referenced :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_if_content_part" kindref="compound">IfContentPart</ref></computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>V</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the values stored in a referenced :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_if_content_part" kindref="compound">IfContentPart</ref></computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>KeyHash</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A hasher for <computeroutput>K</computeroutput>. Defaults to <computeroutput>std::hash&lt;K&gt;</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>KeyEqual</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>An equality comparator for <computeroutput>K</computeroutput>. Defaults to <computeroutput>std::equal_to&lt;K&gt;</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
